# Dream Leash (`Enchant:Permanent`, `ValidTarget$ Permanent.untapped |
# EffectZone$ Stack`) with an untapped and a tapped Forest. ai's own five
# Islands are tapped to pay for it, so they are legal targets too; the
# untapped Forest (id 8) is the one permanent the line refuses. The queued
# enchant target is the tapped Forest (id 1): the Aura attaches to it and
# `GainControl$ You` hands it to ai.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 U
tapformana ai 3 U
tapformana ai 4 U
tapformana ai 5 U
tapformana ai 6 U
queue enchanttarget 1
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue action ai cast 7
passpriority
